        <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/cosmos/cdisc_biomedical_concepts_latest/C16150/C171435> ,
        <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/cosmos/cdisc_biomedical_concepts_latest/C16150/C25372> ,
        <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/cosmos/cdisc_biomedical_concepts_latest/C16150/C25692> ,
